Ritsu client patch 1 of 2: offline client, i.e. everything except local profiles.

- Offline API, Torii catalogue, mods, library, commands, collections, song select, results and performance work.
- Like before the split, this patch applies to the bundled Ritsu client state rather than to clean public
  Torii source (see ROADMAP.md), and Bootstrap.ps1 checks it in reverse against client/.

Apply client-local-profiles.patch on top. The client only builds with both patches applied.

